": "2336409813835635", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827973_2336409817168968_5607520796052531094_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MEtOCn1pOsUQ7kNvwE6gqH7&_nc_oc=AdqejpG7AWNgejQR9_3EjPYnsyX1ZYoHtYJIh_tppbEpUfhCypAGvPaSBe8FC_QCL0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHirnTo5GveLNNxe6HBO0RQlQThjGKuQ563mAGaduuJJg&oe=6A8ED94B"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0003.png", "id": "28390955860505407", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507843239_28390955863838740_8957250939890274140_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i1ss47Y6mhsQ7kNvwGilxKA&_nc_oc=AdoFAoQNmV_QJryXILWzzgGa7VcUCzGScCiHMUx0KwzN80jfgxVbtEz9lvIL0MnL0BI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHVIHtCmg-aazE3FTX1O_2Za-UZIGFDo0zmuNpYdri3XQ&oe=6A8EE496"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_005_0003.png", "id": "2143922083215439", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829120_2143922086548772_4485103318723119630_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MqTvmLHweRoQ7kNvwGr0PBO&_nc_oc=AdqzMGGbqqJ3O73c7_lPdN7ufftYHuWxUM-iNJeP4mTWRRYKfIepL4o9lrWeFS5VhwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGWpr_N7eiY9i1dv-vwldOpUXs2D-FTtXEMaVoU-HIzMQ&oe=6A8ECAEE"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_008_0005.png", "id": "1045947618348351", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673738609_1045947621681684_6875772398486868778_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FYNdseIHbIQ7kNvwHT4vhR&_nc_oc=Adqyg50KDxW0JhXmMaSpqimVwtSdxkDlqI2JhxL9PWHlHfgZ92U5sEbhHY9hfjWuUaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGzGjlSn9r5HMkQpZbduQvXsBVdcRjLJF8pPt-cHoozg&oe=6A8EF6F9"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_009_0000.png", "id": "1046028731616774", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828583_1046028734950107_7424556717022828837_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LtAtk9JcIgAQ7kNvwHh3K9q&_nc_oc=Ado9of96_z7cK0l9L8CHteVC0wtsQp39hipMyYjbhfZ3RO4OXLmh1XYK3EoaDKz-jvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFV-S__As0yGatlVAoo7dSEZytjCknqWxL_xpneLkFgxw&oe=6A8EFAF8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a steppe archer, training at your own pace and facing trials that demand greater focus with every shot."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crocos.kz/politika-konfidenczialnosti-nomad-shooter", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CROCOS GAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crocos.kz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb":